# backup and ops hold the VM's instance principal and the lakeFS/Postgres keys, so CI fails on any HIGH finding there,
# except this one: a read-only root filesystem needs per-image writable paths (OCI CLI cache, Postgres socket, lakeFS
# home) and is the next hardening step (docs/PLAN.md). Everything else (non-root, no capabilities, no privilege
# escalation, seccomp) is enforced.
